# Vox uses the Claude Agent SDK, which authenticates via your locally-
# installed Claude Code CLI (and therefore your Claude Max plan).
# No API key is needed by default.
#
# ---- Model selection ----
# By default Vox uses different models for different jobs:
#   - Interviewer turns: claude-sonnet-4-6 (fast, conversational, ~5x less quota)
#   - Final evaluation:  claude-opus-4-7   (best reasoning for the scored report)
#
# Override individually:
# CLAUDE_INTERVIEWER_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
# CLAUDE_EVALUATOR_MODEL=claude-opus-4-7
#
# Or override both at once:
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
#
# ---- Auth ----
# Optional: force API-key billing instead of Max plan. Only set this if you
# WANT to spend API credits rather than use your Max quota.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
